   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD Improving business and investment climate    Iraq 2013-2016 - OECD Capacity for investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution aims to improve the business and investment climate in   Iraq through capacity building and policy dialogue with key actors.   the main cooperation partners to the OECD is the national investment  commission, NIC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra investerings- och f&#xf6;retagsklimatet i Irak genom kapacitetsst&#xf6;d och policy dialog. OECD:s prim&#xe4;ra         samarbetspart i Irak &#xe4;r nationella investeringskommissionen.</narrative>
